  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "",
   "body": "<p>The ZOLLER »smile | GBO« setting and measuring device with large-screen optics enables particularly precise height measurement thanks to its additional Z-axis – a clear advantage for form and profile tools. High mechanical stability, sensitive feed, and large-screen optical display ensure precisely reproducible length determination and reliable detection of even the smallest contour details. The Z-axis also makes the device particularly flexible and universally applicable for different tool lengths and types.</p>",
